<title>USA: U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10.385 million bushels of U.S. soybeans inspected for export in the week ended Sept 26 were for the following destinations (1,000 bushels):</p>
<p>Mississippi River to Barbados 55; Belgium 2,098; Costa Rica 409; Germany 2,167; Japan 2,534; South Korea 1,995 and Netherlands 436</p>
<p>Interior to Mexico 691</p>
</text>
